  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comprehensive Development Autochthonous People</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Desarrollo Integral Pueblos Autctonos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es contribuir a mejorar las condiciones de vida de los pueblos autctonos de Honduras y contribuir a su desarrollo integral y sostenible en los mbitos econmico, social, cultural y ambiental. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) mejorar las capacidades y oportunidades de las comunidades en el mbito productivo y de desarrollo humano; (ii) fortalecer la auto gestin de las organizaciones indgenas y afro-descendientes representativas a nivel comunitario, local, regional y nacional as como las instituciones del gobierno que interacten con ellas; y (iii) fortalecer a la SGJ en su rol rector en los asuntos de los pueblos autctonos. El Programa tiene un carcter integral, intersectorial y participativo, incorporando de manera transversal los aspectos de inclusin social, de gnero y de medio ambiente en sus intervenciones.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program will contribute to improving the quality of life of the native population of Honduras and will contribute to its integral and sustainable development in the economic, social, cultural and environmental areas. In particular, the Program will seek to: (i) improve the productive and human development capacities and opportunities of the communities; (ii) strengthen the internal organization and representativeness of the indigenous and afro-descendant organizations at the local, regional and national level, as well as that of the government institutions that interact with these groups; and (iii) strengthen the SGJ in its regulatory role with respect to the native population. The Program has an integral, intersectorial and participatory character, and incorporates social inclusion, gender and environmental aspects into its interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
